{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:31 2026-07-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:31 2026-07-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:31 2026-07-25 HKT</p><p>今(25日)早上11時半，將軍澳寶邑路近唐俊街燈位，一名男子駕駛電單車往調景嶺方向右三線，駛至上址燈位停車等候期間，尾隨一輛客貨車煞掣不及，直撞電單車車尾，電單車鐵騎士墮地受傷，稍後送往將軍澳醫院治理，客貨車司機在場協查，警方正了解意外原因。</p><img alt=\"電單車被客貨車撞尾，鐵騎士倒地受傷。香港鐵騎館fb\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bf7293a1bacff2da4012e0628eb6deb7/2026-07/753557002_1450452390450843_5820930629009517637_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"電單車被客貨車撞尾，鐵騎士倒地受傷。香港鐵騎館fb\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6b98eb68c12d6b45c7d74c4445f0db02/2026-07/753646814_1450452367117512_7696942564935239051_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"電單車損毀輕微。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5fcffb29ea169d718f7b20717c18dff5/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-25_at_12_13_27.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"客貨車司機在場協查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b78c27f33af81ad0cbb0941d5cac700f/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-25_at_12_13_25_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/82b882630b16c21ea5a07f638abba0d7/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-25_at_12_13_25.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"電單車司機受傷送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/97d576a9cab03ca3df8b62b9f6760bc1/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-25_at_12_13_24.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T04:59:28.687613+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}